    "summary": "In the [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), each time one of this unit's models is **destroyed**, roll a D6 if this unit is yet to be **selected to fight** in that phase. Add 1 if an enemy unit the destroyed model was **[engaged](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range)** with has a **T** equal to or greater than this unit's **T**. A result of 4+ leaves that model on the battlefield until whichever comes first:\n\n- this unit has fought\n- the phase ends",
